Open-weights model
------------------

The optional local model is Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct, exposed through Ollama as
`qwen2.5:3b`. Its official model card identifies the weights license as
`qwen-research`; see https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct. The
weights are neither distributed nor downloaded by this repository. Operators
must independently review and accept the applicable license.

Simulated integrations
----------------------

Every integration below is a demonstration mock. It does not contact a
production system, obtain official records, or create legally significant
operations:

- ЕГРЮЛ/ЕГРИП — company and sole-proprietor registry data;
- ФНС «Прозрачный бизнес» — revenue, headcount, taxes and tax debt;
- БКИ — credit history, debt and delinquency data;
- АБС — balances, turnover, debt payments and disbursement simulation;
- ПЭП — simple electronic signature workflow and signing status.

Product and organization names only describe compatibility or mocked systems;
no endorsement or affiliation is implied.
